                                    <h1>Best D2C Marketing Agency in Hyderabad 2026 &mdash; Picking Guide for Consumer Brand Founders</h1>

                                    <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> For Hyderabad D2C brands in 2026, the right agency has <strong>direct category experience</strong> (Hyderabad strong in pharma + biotech + healthtech + traditional jewellery + tech), <strong>Telugu + regional creative capability</strong> for Telangana + Andhra Pradesh expansion, <strong>YMYL + compliance SEO for healthcare</strong>, and <strong>senior practitioner</strong>. Retainers <strong>&#8377;1.5L&ndash;&#8377;6L/month + ad spend</strong>. Biggest red flag: no compliance experience for a pharma / biotech brand.</p>
                                    <p>This is the picking guide we give Hyderabad D2C founders evaluating marketing agencies in 2026. Hyderabad has India&rsquo;s largest pharmaceutical + biotech cluster + a strong tech ecosystem + traditional Nizami jewellery + tier-2 Telangana / Andhra Pradesh markets. Here&rsquo;s how to filter agencies that understand these dynamics.</p>

